{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：14:03 2026-09-17 HKT</p>\n<p>流浮山雞伯嶺路鳳降村一個貨倉，今日（17日）下午1時15分發生火警，火勢猛烈並冒出大量濃煙。消防接報到場撲救，至下午1時29分將火勢級別升為三級。據報現場貨倉面積約50米乘30米，最少25男1女疏散，​火警中暫未接獲受傷報告。</p>\n<img alt=\"起火時貨倉濃煙衝天。Threads\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d052aad7b39153782ac70e1b1d583b47/2026-09/813765504_18127885591792420_3276074044553230610_n_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"濃煙離遠清晰可見。Threads\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4698455e69853faece4983541ed6cbf5/2026-09/813322804_18127885678792420_4705542540147120156_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防在場灌救。FB：消防處\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bda8c48c093bef44349a2ba3d7b88b14/2026-09/813804641_1052030397647759_2794766703829048197_n.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防在場灌救。FB：消防處\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7a68301e70995dcb3940db6e443ac8d/2026-09/813428711_1372756857922252_8138442755222798914_n.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場動用4喉4煙帽隊灌救。FB：消防處\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7161f30bc0473cd97d29e43029e67465/2026-09/813837252_2316680672412650_521553287309823194_n.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場動用4喉4煙帽隊灌救。FB：消防處\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b8f02ca3c260fed04e429f6d4821111/2026-09/813756675_1421128523299317_4576557335542070198_n.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防員輪番出動救火。FB：消防處\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce430746da9c6b787525777b2e4ca328/2026-09/813853706_1067980932693390_1690168599658883454_n.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防員輪番出動救火。FB：消防處\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8df328348953d9354245856d08ee9f7a/2026-09/813361302_2843034162744264_3619879457904468376_n.jpeg\"/>\n<p>據了解起火的是一個儲有木材的貨倉，現場所見火警發生後，黑煙沖天。消防一度動用2條喉及2兩隊煙帽隊灌救，但其後再多派2隊煙帽隊，以及再動用多2條喉救火。據報至下午3時許，火勢已經受控。</p>\n<p>消防處呼籲市民請盡量避免靠近火場，如身處室內並受到煙霧或異味影響，請立刻關閉門窗，保持室內通風系統適當運作。</p>\n<img alt=\"鳳降村一貨倉發生三級火。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cefd7010e60ee2daaae94eceef2acb15/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_53_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防進行撲救。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fbb64b616a606c44c7cdac21f0a8651e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_53_09.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df5f6f775ab27fb3c80f55f10f3b12c6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_53_08.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"火警現場濃煙沖天。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c80101485163782d3f5e1a241b378400/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_53_07_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e89455655a21a8518bbdadd17f5c3ba/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_52_41_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d162f12d6240104501512ac802a02b1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_52_39_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65f1eaa5fdb7a12f6e5a67d3feff2461/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_14_52_39.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"人員出動機械人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/643bcf7dfd48c3644a52040161f429f2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_15_16_00.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3642b9cdb24cb8778c7e62847d8164b6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_15_15_59.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"亦派出無人機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9d8085309eef58e57da593d7f45a451/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-17_at_15_21_59.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T08:58:44.453121+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":18,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}